{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "GEN",
  "chapter": 11,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "GEN.11.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.11.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the whole earth was of one language, and of one speech.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.11.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.11.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass as they journeyed from the east, that they found a plain in the land of Shinar, and they dwelt there.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.11.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.11.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they said one to another, come, let us make brick, and burn them thoroughly. And they had brick for stone, and slime had they for mortar.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.11.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.11.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they said, come, let us build us a city, and a tower, whose top ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "may reach",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to heaven; and let us make us a name, lest we should be scattered abroad upon the face of the whole earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.11.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.11.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the LORD came down to see the city and the tower, which the children of men were building.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.11.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.11.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the LORD said, Behold, the people ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " one, and they have all one language; and this they begin to do: and now nothing will be restrained from them, which they have imagined to do.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.11.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.11.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Come, let us go down, and there confound their language, that they may not understand one another's speech.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.11.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.11.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So the LORD scattered them abroad from thence upon the face of all the earth: and they left off to build the city.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.11.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.11.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore is the name of it called Babel, because the LORD there confounded the language of all the earth: and from thence did the LORD scatter them abroad upon the face of all the earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.11.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.11.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the generations of Shem: Shem ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a hundred years old, and begat Arphaxad two years after the flood:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.11.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.11.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Shem lived after he begat Arphaxad five hundred years, and begat sons and daughters.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.11.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.11.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Arphaxad lived five and thirty years, and begat Salah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.11.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.11.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Arphaxad lived after he begat Salah four hundred and three years, and begat sons and daughters.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.11.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.11.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Salah lived thirty years, and begat Eber:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.11.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.11.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Salah lived after he begat Eber four hundred and three years, and begat sons and daughters.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.11.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.11.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Eber lived four and thirty years, and begat Peleg:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.11.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.11.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Eber lived after he begat Peleg four hundred and thirty years, and begat sons and daughters.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.11.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.11.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Peleg lived thirty years, and begat Reu:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.11.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.11.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Peleg lived after he begat Reu two hundred and nine years, and begat sons and daughters.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.11.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.11.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Reu lived two and thirty years, and begat Serug.",
